### MiniCore - coleccion de requests para los escenarios de aceptacion E1-E12
### Funciona con la extension "REST Client" de VS Code (Visual Studio 2022 usa {{login.response.body.$.token}}).
### Antes de repetir un escenario, reinicia los datos ejecutando db/02_seed_and_reset.sql.
### La API debe estar corriendo en Development:  dotnet run --project src/MiniCore.Api   (http://localhost:5080)

@host = http://localhost:5080

### ---------- Tokens simulados (solo existen en Development) ----------

# @name cust01
GET {{host}}/dev/token/CUST-01

###
# @name cust02
GET {{host}}/dev/token/CUST-02

###
# @name cust03
GET {{host}}/dev/token/CUST-03

###
# @name cust04
GET {{host}}/dev/token/CUST-04

###
# @name cust06
GET {{host}}/dev/token/CUST-06

###
# @name operator
GET {{host}}/dev/token/OPERATOR

###
# @name auditor
GET {{host}}/dev/token/AUDITOR

### ---------- E1: ACC-1001 -> ACC-1002, 100,00 => 201, comision 0, saldos 9.900,00 y 350,00 ----------
# @name e1
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "USD", "description": "E1" }

### ---------- E2: 1.000,00 => 201, comision 5,00, debito total 1.005,00, saldo origen 8.995,00 ----------
# @name e2
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 1000.00, "currency": "USD", "description": "Pago factura 123" }

### ---------- E3: 501,00 => comision 3,00 (minimo) ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333331
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 501.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E3: 1.234,57 => comision 6,17 (redondeo de 6,17285)
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333332
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 1234.57, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E4: ACC-1006 (501,00) -> ACC-1002, 501,00 => 422 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust06.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1006", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 501.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E5: ACC-1004 envia 3.000, luego 2.000 (201 ambas) y luego 1,00 (422 DAILY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED) ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust04.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555551
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1004", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1001", "amount": 3000.00, "currency": "USD" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust04.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555552
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1004", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1001", "amount": 2000.00, "currency": "USD" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust04.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555553
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1004", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1001", "amount": 1.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E6: origen bloqueada (ACC-1003) => 422 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust03.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666661
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1003", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E6: destino cerrada (ACC-1005) => 422 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666662
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1005", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E7: monto 0 => 422 INVALID_AMOUNT ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777771
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 0, "currency": "USD" }

### E7: monto 10,001 => 422 INVALID_AMOUNT
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777772
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 10.001, "currency": "USD" }

### E7: origen = destino => 422 SAME_ACCOUNT
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777773
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1001", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E7: cuenta inexistente => 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777774
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-9999", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E8: reverso de la transferencia de E2 (como Operator) => 200 ----------
### Primero ejecuta E2 y copia el transferId de la respuesta a la variable de abajo.
@transferId = PEGA-AQUI-EL-TRANSFER-ID

POST {{host}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 88888888-8888-8888-8888-888888888881

### E8: segundo reverso (otra clave) => 409 TRANSFER_ALREADY_REVERSED
POST {{host}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 88888888-8888-8888-8888-888888888882

### ---------- E9: la MISMA clave dos veces => segundo 201 con cabecera Idempotent-Replayed: true ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999991
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E9: misma clave, distinto monto => 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999991
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 200.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E9: sin clave => 400 MISSING_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 100.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E10 (concurrencia): se prueba automaticamente en ReversalIdempotencyConcurrencyTests.E10_... ----------
### (10 requests simultaneos no se pueden lanzar con un .http; la prueba de integracion los dispara en paralelo)

### ---------- E11: CUST-01 intenta transferir desde ACC-1002 => 403 ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1002", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1001", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "USD" }

### E11: CUST-01 consulta movimientos de ACC-1002 => 403
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-1002/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}

### E11: el Auditor intenta transferir => 403
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{auditor.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 10.00, "currency": "USD" }

### ---------- E12: falla simulada despues del debito (solo Development) => 500 y NADA cambia ----------
POST {{host}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
Idempotency-Key: bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbb1
X-Simulate-Failure: after-debit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001", "destinationAccountId": "ACC-1002", "amount": 1000.00, "currency": "USD" }

### Verificacion despues de E12: el saldo de ACC-1001 sigue en 10.000,00
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-1001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}

### ---------- Consultas ----------
### F2 - movimientos paginados (size maximo 100) con filtros de fecha: rango [from, to)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-1001/movements?from=2026-01-01&to=2027-01-01&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}

### F5 - saldo
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-1001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}

### F3 - detalle de una transferencia
GET {{host}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cust01.response.body.token}}
